OL,3,GNEWSAFirmus Energy customers face price
OL,4,Aincrease
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirmus Energy has announced an 8.98%
OL,7,Fprice increase for customers in the Ten
OL,8,FTowns area and 12.5% for Greater
OL,9,FBelfast.
OL,11,FThe Ten Towns new tariff will be
OL,12,Feffective from 1 October and equates to
OL,13,Fan extra #7 per month on the average
OL,14,Fbill for customers.
OL,16,FIn greater Belfast, around 54,000
OL,17,Fcustomers' new tariffs will be
OL,18,Feffective from 8 October and equates to
OL,19,Fan extra #12 per month.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
