OL,3,GNEWSAFirmus Energy customers face price
OL,4,Aincrease
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said the increase was "due to the
OL,7,Fincreased cost of gas on the global
OL,8,Fenergy markets caused by the prolonged
OL,9,Fconflict in the Middle East".
